[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2571628717","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101151#issuecomment-2571628717","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101151","id":2571628717,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZR_Ct","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-05T13:34:02Z","updated_at":"2025-01-05T13:34:02Z","body":"The zip file can't be extracted for me, can you please try re-uploading it?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2571628717/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2571643190","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101151#issuecomment-2571643190","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101151","id":2571643190,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZSCk2","user":{"login":"matheusmdx","id":44306054,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzA2MDU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44306054?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx","html_url":"https://github.com/matheusmdx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-05T14:20:47Z","updated_at":"2025-01-05T14:20:47Z","body":"I was able to download and test the mrp, the engine complains about not be able to call `Node::get_script()` because the thread safety checks\n\n```\nE 0:00:01:0216   a.gd:15 @ lambda(): Caller thread can't call this function in this node (/root/A/B). Use call_deferred() or call_thread_group() instead.\n  <C++ Error>    Condition \"!is_accessible_from_caller_thread()\" is true. Returning: (Variant())\n  <C++ Source>   C:\\Users\\Matheus\\Downloads\\Godot Source\\scene/main/node.cpp:3988 @ Node::get_script()\n  <Stack Trace>  a.gd:15 @ lambda()\n\nE 0:00:01:0217   a.gd:15 @ lambda(): Attempted to push_back an object into a TypedArray, that does not inherit from 'GDScript'.\n  <C++ Error>    Condition \"other_script.is_null()\" is true. Returning: false\n  <C++ Source>   C:\\Users\\Matheus\\Downloads\\Godot Source\\core\\variant\\container_type_validate.h:145 @ ContainerTypeValidate::validate_object()\n  <Stack Trace>  a.gd:15 @ lambda()\n\nE 0:00:01:0218   a.gd:15 @ lambda(): Condition \"!_p->typed.validate(value, \"push_back\")\" is true.\n  <C++ Source>   C:\\Users\\Matheus\\Downloads\\Godot Source\\core/variant/array.cpp:283 @ Array::push_back()\n  <Stack Trace>  a.gd:15 @ lambda()\n```\n\n<br>\n\nBut using `Thread.set_thread_safety_checks_enabled(false)` made the code works without issues, so i'm guessing @filkata just called this in the main thread instead the secondary thread.\n\n```\nextends Node2D\n@onready var node_ref : MyClass = $B\n\n\nvar arr : Array[MyClass]\n\nfunc _ready():\n\t# If you call this here it will not work and will raise an error\n\t#Thread.set_thread_safety_checks_enabled(false)\n\tarr = []\n\tvar thread : Thread = Thread.new()\n\tthread.start(lambda)\n\t\n\t\nfunc lambda():\n\t# You need to call it on the function that will be called by the\n\t# secondary thread\n\tThread.set_thread_safety_checks_enabled(false)\n\tarr.append(node_ref)\n\tvar _c = 5\n\tprint(arr)\n```\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2571643190/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2571651753","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101151#issuecomment-2571651753","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101151","id":2571651753,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZSEqp","user":{"login":"filkata","id":1313329,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMTMzMjk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1313329?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/filkata","html_url":"https://github.com/filkata","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/filkata/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/filkata/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/filkata/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/filkata/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/filkata/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/filkata/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/filkata/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/filkata/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/filkata/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-05T14:50:33Z","updated_at":"2025-01-05T14:50:33Z","body":"@matheusmdx was correct, I had been confused about how to correctly call set_thread_safety_checks_enabled, I assumed it was to be called on a Thread instance, e.g\n```\nvar thread : Thread = Thread.new()\nthread.set_thread_safety_checks_enabled(false)\n```\nI personally think a clarification in the docs about this would be nice, but I leave it up for discussion. Thanks for your time.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2571651753/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2571935045","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101151#issuecomment-2571935045","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101151","id":2571935045,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZTJ1F","user":{"login":"carsonetb","id":63245844,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMjQ1ODQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63245844?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/carsonetb","html_url":"https://github.com/carsonetb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carsonetb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carsonetb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carsonetb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carsonetb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carsonetb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carsonetb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carsonetb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carsonetb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carsonetb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-06T01:44:06Z","updated_at":"2025-01-06T01:44:06Z","body":"Even if that does fix the problem, it's a workaround and not a solution. You should be able to append a custom class to a typed array (and least with a mutex locked if append is not thread safe?), I think this should be considered a bug.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2571935045/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2572628779","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101151#issuecomment-2572628779","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101151","id":2572628779,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZVzMr","user":{"login":"matheusmdx","id":44306054,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzA2MDU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44306054?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx","html_url":"https://github.com/matheusmdx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-06T09:05:17Z","updated_at":"2025-01-06T09:05:17Z","body":"@carsonetb From my understanding the problem here is the interaction with the scene tree, look the code i put in my last comentary, that's from the mrp (except the comments and the `Thread.set_thread_safety_checks_enabled(false)`). The problematic part is the `$B` because you're using a node inside the scene tree and for append a value in a typed array the engine needs to check if that value is valid, but for this the engine rely on a function that is not thread safe.\n\nNow if you create a new node and add them to the array before add to the scene tree or remove the node from scene tree before add to the array, you'll not be required to disable the thread safety.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2572628779/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4485603403","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101151#issuecomment-4485603403","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101151","id":4485603403,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABC1zgSw","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-19T07:55:28Z","updated_at":"2026-05-19T07:55:28Z","body":"Moving this to `core`. This issue is related to our Node thread safety strategy not GDScript. Only for nodes is `get_script` limited to the main thread, I don't get the bigger picture here, but the core team will have to decide whether this is intended or needs addressing.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4485603403/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]